2332.html,Fuel Filter: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine,3,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;FUEL FILTER;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL 1,"Fuel Filter: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Tune-up and Engine Performance Checks >> Fuel Filter >> Service and Repair Fuel Filter: Service and Repair FUEL FILTER REMOVAL 1. Release the fuel system pressure. 2. Disconnect the fuel tube from the rear of the fuel filter . 3. Disconnect the fuel tube from the front of the fuel filter . 4. Remove the fuel filter . INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
