2497.html,Description of Diagnostic Methods — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;DIAGNOSTIC;LEMON;METHODS;OBD II,"Description of Diagnostic Methods — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Computers and Control Systems >> Testing and Inspection >> Scan Tool Testing and Procedures >> Description of Diagnostic Methods Description of Diagnostic Methods DIAGNOSTIC METHODS Overview The Diagnostic Methods provides information on routine diagnostic tasks. When following powertrain diagnostic on OBD II vehicles, the system may be checked by an off-board tester referred to as a scan tool. It contains information for performing diagnostics with a scan tool. A scan tool has certain generic capabilities that are standard across the automotive industry in the United States. All functions are selected from a menu. Refer to the instruction manual provided by the tool manufacturer. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
