2619.html,Fuel Pump: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,,3,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;FUEL PUMP;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL;SPECIAL TOLL;WARNING,"Fuel Pump: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Fuel Delivery and Air Induction >> Fuel Pump >> Service and Repair Fuel Pump: Service and Repair FUEL PUMP Wrench, Fuel Tank Lock Ring: SPECIAL TOLL(S) REMOVAL WARNING: Do not smoke, carry lighted tobacco or open flame of any type when working on or near any fuel-related component. Highly flammable mixtures are always present and may be ignited, resulting in possible personal injury. 1. Remove the fuel tank . 2. Remove the fuel tube from the fuel pump . 3. Clean the area around the fuel pump locking ring. 4. CAUTION: The fuel pump assembly must be handled carefully to avoid damage to the float arm and the filter. Using the special tool, remove the fuel pump locking ring and remove the fuel pump assembly. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
