2681.html,Ignition Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Suspension;Body;Wiring;Interior,5,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;LEMON;NOTE,"Ignition Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Ignition System >> Sensors and Switches - Ignition System >> Ignition Switch >> Service and Repair Ignition Switch: Service and Repair Ignition Switch Removal and Installation 1. Depower the supplemental restraint system (SRS) . 2. Detach the hood latch release handle and position aside. 1. Remove the bolts. 2. Position the hood latch release handle aside. 3. Remove the lower instrument panel steering column cover. 1. Remove the screws. 2. Remove the lower instrument panel steering column cover. 4. Remove the instrument panel steering column opening cover reinforcement. 1. Remove the bolts. 2. Remove the instrument panel steering column opening cover reinforcement. 5. Disconnect the electrical connector. 1. Loosen the bolt. 2. Disconnect the electrical connector. 6. NOTE: The ignition key should be in the OFF position. Remove the ignition switch . 1. Remove the screws. 2. Remove the ignition switch . 7. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
