3689.html,Module Controlled Functions — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CONTROLLED;FUNCTIONS;LEMON;MODULE,Module Controlled Functions — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Body Control Systems >> Description and Operation >> Module Controlled Functions Module Controlled Functions MODULE CONTROLLED FUNCTIONS The vehicle security module is a multifunction module that controls several vehicle subsystems. The vehicle security module continually monitors the following systems: - power locks - remote keyless entry (RKE)/ keyless entry (keypad) - autolamps scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals
3690.html,Vehicle Security Module — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Interior,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;9141;LEMON;OPERATION;PRINCIPLES OF,"Vehicle Security Module — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Body Control Systems >> Description and Operation >> Vehicle Security Module Vehicle Security Module PRINCIPLES OF OPERATION The vehicle security module is on the international standards organization (ISO) 9141 communication network. To support vehicle security module diagnostics, the diagnostic tool must request all information or initiate module commands. The vehicle security module controls the power door lock system. The module monitors the door lock/unlock switch inputs from the interior door lock switches. When the module receives an unlock/lock command from any door lock control switch, the module will activate the door lock actuators. The module also controls the following lock/unlock features: - remote keyless entry (RKE) - keyless entry The vehicle security module controls the autolamp subsystem. The autolamp subsystem provides light-sensitive automatic on/off control of the headlamps and parking lamps. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
