3931.html,Truck Bed: Description and Operation — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;LEMON;PICKUP BED,Truck Bed: Description and Operation — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Truck Bed >> Description and Operation Truck Bed: Description and Operation PICKUP BED The pickup bed consists of the following components: - bed extender (optional) - box inner panel - body side outer moulding - body side outer panels - cargo divider (optional) - front body extension panels - fuel filler door - fuel filler housing - pickup bed inner tie-downs - pickup bed exterior tie-downs - pickup bed reinforcement assembly - power point receptacle - power point receptacle panel - rear wheel house panels - tonneau cover (optional) - tailgate assembly - wiring harnesses scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals
3932.html,Pickup Bed Alignment — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body,6,Tighten the pickup bed bolts. 6. Install the four bumper cover screws. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;ALIGNMENT 1;LEMON;PICKUP BED,Pickup Bed Alignment — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Truck Bed >> Adjustments >> Pickup Bed Alignment Pickup Bed Alignment PICKUP BED ALIGNMENT 1. Remove the four bumper cover screws. 2. Loosen the pickup bed bolts. 3. Center the pickup bed to the rear of the cab. 4. Align the leading edge of the pickup bed and the rear of the cab to specification. 5. Tighten the pickup bed bolts. 6. Install the four bumper cover screws. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals
3933.html,Pickup Bed Lean - Measurements — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body,0,,0.25 in;0.70 in;1.20 in;18.00 mm;30.50 mm;30.50mm;6.50 mm,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;LEAN;LEMON;MEASUREMENTS 1;PICKUP BED,Pickup Bed Lean - Measurements — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Truck Bed >> Adjustments >> Pickup Bed Lean - Measurements Pickup Bed Lean - Measurements PICKUP BED LEAN - MEASUREMENTS 1. Check the vehicle ride height. 2. Check the vehicle frame height. 3. Measure and record the distance from the top center of both wheel well lips and calculate the difference. 4. If the difference between the two sides is between 0 and 6.50 mm (0 and 0.25 in) do nothing. 5. If the difference between the two measurements is 6.50 and 18.00 mm (0.25 and 0.70 in) shim the axle. 6. If the difference between the two measurements is between 18.00 and 30.50mm (0.70 and 1.20 in) shim the pickup bed. 7. If the difference is greater than 30.50 mm (1.20 in) shim both the axle and the pickup bed. 8. Align the pickup bed. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals
3934.html,Pickup Bed Shimming — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body,2,tighten the pickup bed bolts. 6. Align the pickup bed. 7. Recheck the vehicle lean. 8. Align the rear bumper cover as necessary. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manual,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;LEMON;NOTE;PICKUP BED;SHIMMING 1,Pickup Bed Shimming — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Truck Bed >> Adjustments >> Pickup Bed Shimming Pickup Bed Shimming PICKUP BED SHIMMING 1. Determine the need for shimming. 2. Loosen the pickup bed bolts. 3. NOTE: Label the pickup bed bolts because they are not identical and must be installed in the same location that they are removed from. Remove the bolts on the low side of the pickup bed. 4. Raise the low side of the pickup bed and install shims between the top of the frame and the bottom of the pickup bed crossmembers. 5. Install and tighten the pickup bed bolts. 6. Align the pickup bed. 7. Recheck the vehicle lean. 8. Align the rear bumper cover as necessary. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals
3935.html,Axle Shimming — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Suspension;Body;Wiring,2,Tighten the rear axle U-bolt nuts. 6. Lower the vehicle. 7. Recheck the vehicle lean. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals,0.24 in;0.5 in;13 mm;6 mm,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;5560;AXLE SHIMMING NOTE;LEMON;NOTE,"Axle Shimming — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Truck Bed >> Adjustments >> Axle Shimming Axle Shimming AXLE SHIMMING NOTE: A side to side lean may be adjusted by 6 mm (0.24 in) by placing a shim between the rear spring (5560) and the axle on the low side of the vehicle. 1. Determine the need for shimming. 2. Without removing the tires from the ground, raise the vehicle enough to take the weight off of the rear springs. 3. Loosen the rear axle U-bolt nuts. - Separate the spring and the axle approximately 13 mm (0.5 in) . 4. NOTE: On 4x4 vehicles place the shim between the rear spring and the axle spacer. Install the shim. 5. Tighten the rear axle U-bolt nuts. 6. Lower the vehicle. 7. Recheck the vehicle lean. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
