4067.html,Pinpoint Test Notes — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Wiring;Interior,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;LEMON;NOTE,"Pinpoint Test Notes — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Instrument Panel, Gauges and Warning Indicators >> Testing and Inspection >> Pinpoint Tests >> Pinpoint Tests - Warning Devices >> Pinpoint Test Notes Pinpoint Test Notes CAUTION: - Be careful when probing the BJB, CJB or any connectors. Damage will result to the connector receptacle if the probe or terminal being used is too large. - Electronic modules are sensitive to static discharges. If exposed to these charges, damage may result. NOTE: If continuous DTCs are recorded and the symptom is not present when carrying out the pinpoint tests, an intermittent concern may be the cause. Always check for loose connections and corroded terminals. Complete the entire pinpoint test related to the symptom before installing a new instrument cluster. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
