5695.html,Wiper Blade: Adjustments — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,,2,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;ARM ADJUSTMENT;BLADE AND PIVOT;LEMON;WINDSHIELD WIPER,"Wiper Blade: Adjustments — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Wiper and Washer Systems >> Wiper Blade >> Adjustments Wiper Blade: Adjustments WINDSHIELD WIPER BLADE AND PIVOT ARM ADJUSTMENT 1. Cycle and park the windshield wipers. 2. Verify that the distance between the center of the passenger windshield wiper blade and the rear edge of the cowl top vent panel is within specification. 3. Verify that the distance between the center of the driver windshield wiper blade and the rear edge of the cowl top vent panel is within specification. 4. If the distance is not within specification, remove the windshield wiper pivot arms and reposition to specification. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
