5785.html,Front Door Window Motor: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring,4,,0.52 in;13 mm,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;FRONT DOOR;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REGULATOR MOTOR;REMOVAL 1;WINDOW,"Front Door Window Motor: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Windows and Glass >> Windows >> Power Window Motor >> Front Door Window Motor >> Service and Repair Front Door Window Motor: Service and Repair FRONT DOOR WINDOW REGULATOR MOTOR REMOVAL 1. Remove the front door trim panel . 2. Remove the front door speaker. 1 Remove the screws. 2 Disconnect the electrical connector. 3 Remove the speaker. 3. Remove the water shield. 4. Disconnect the front door window regulator motor electrical connector. 5. Drill a 13 mm (0.52 in) hole using the locator in the door sheet metal as a guide. 6. Remove the bolts and the front door window regulator motor. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. - Cycle the door glass to make sure of engagement of the drive mechanism. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
