5986.html,Headlamp Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Suspension;Body;Wiring;Interior,7,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;HEADLAMP;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL 1;SWITCH,"Headlamp Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Lighting and Horns >> Headlamp >> Headlamp Switch >> Service and Repair Headlamp Switch: Service and Repair HEADLAMP SWITCH REMOVAL 1. Disconnect the battery. 2. Remove the instrument panel center finish panel. 1 Remove the screws. 2 Remove the instrument panel center finish panel. - Disconnect electrical connectors. 3. Remove the hood latch release handle. 1 Remove the screws. 2 Remove the hood latch release handle. 4. Remove the lower instrument panel steering column cover. 1 Remove the screws. 2 Remove the lower instrument panel steering column cover. 5. Remove the bolts and the lower instrument panel reinforcement. 6. If equipped, position the column gear shift lever out of the way. 7. Position the instrument cluster finish panel aside. 1 Remove the screws. 2 Position the cluster finish panel aside. 8. Remove the cluster finish panel. 1 Disconnect the electrical connectors and remove the headlamp switch knob. 2 Remove the cluster finish panel. 9. Remove the headlamp switch . 1 Remove the screws. 2 Remove the headlamp switch . INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
