6037.html,Dimmer Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Transmission;Suspension;Body;Wiring;Interior,7,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;DIMMER;INSTALLATION 1;INSTRUMENT PANEL;LEMON;REMOVAL 1;SWITCH,"Dimmer Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Lighting and Horns >> Dimmer Switch >> Service and Repair Dimmer Switch: Service and Repair INSTRUMENT PANEL DIMMER SWITCH REMOVAL 1. Disconnect the battery. 2. Remove the center instrument panel finish panel. - Remove the screws. - Disconnect the electrical connectors. 3. Remove the screws and position the hood latch release handle aside. 4. Remove the screws and remove the instrument panel steering column cover. 5. Remove the instrument panel steering column opening cover reinforcement. 6. Position the column-mounted transmission range selector lever aside. 7. Remove the screws and pull the instrument cluster finish panel out from the instrument panel. 8. Disconnect the headlamp and the dimmer switch electrical connectors and remove the instrument cluster finish panel. 9. Remove the screws and the instrument panel dimmer switch. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
