ew Vehicle Limited Warranty Coverage OPERATION DESCRIPTION TIME 051008A 2001-2003 Explorer Sport 0.3 Hr. (2Dr), 2001-2004 Explorer Sport Trac, 2003-2004 Ranger, Replace The Center Finish Panel (Do Not Use With 18805B, 18805C) DEALER CODING CONDITION BASIC PART NO. CODE 7004302 42 Disclaimer scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
