6195.html,Dimmer Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Transmission;Suspension;Body;Wiring;Interior,7,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;DIMMER;INSTALLATION 1;INSTRUMENT PANEL;LEMON;REMOVAL 1;SWITCH,"Dimmer Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Instrument Panel, Gauges and Warning Indicators >> Dimmer Switch >> Service and Repair Dimmer Switch: Service and Repair INSTRUMENT PANEL DIMMER SWITCH REMOVAL 1. Disconnect the battery. 2. Remove the center instrument panel finish panel. - Remove the screws. - Disconnect the electrical connectors. 3. Remove the screws and position the hood latch release handle aside. 4. Remove the screws and remove the instrument panel steering column cover. 5. Remove the instrument panel steering column opening cover reinforcement. 6. Position the column-mounted transmission range selector lever aside. 7. Remove the screws and pull the instrument cluster finish panel out from the instrument panel. 8. Disconnect the headlamp and the dimmer switch electrical connectors and remove the instrument cluster finish panel. 9. Remove the screws and the instrument panel dimmer switch. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
6196.html,Interior - Instrument Center Trim Panel Peeling/Cracking — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Interior,2,,,05 PAINT;051008A 2001;0L VIN K;18805B;18805C;19590-A;1960-2025;2001-2003;2001-2004;2003;2003-2004;2004;2WD V6-4;ACTION;AVOID GETTING;BACK SIDE OF;CENTER;CODE 7004302 42;CODING;CONDITION BASIC;CRACKING ON;DEALER;DESCRIPTION TIME;FINISH PANEL;FORD;GREASE ON;GREASE THE;INSTALLING THE;INSTRUMENT PANEL;ISSUE;LEMON;LIGHTLY;LUBRICANT;NEW CENTER;NOISE;NOTE PRIOR TO;OPERATION;PART NO;PART NUMBER D2AZ;PEELING;SQUEAK;STATUS;THE FACE OF;THE NEW PANEL;THE PANEL;TO PREVENT;TSB 05-10;WARRANTY;WITH ANTI-,"Interior - Instrument Center Trim Panel Peeling/Cracking — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Instrument Panel, Gauges and Warning Indicators >> Dashboard / Instrument Panel >> Technical Service Bulletins >> Customer Interest >> Interior - Instrument Center Trim Panel Peeling/Cracking Interior - Instrument Center Trim Panel Peeling/Cracking TSB 05-10-8 05/30/05 PAINT PEELING/CRACKING ON CENTER FINISH PANEL FORD: 2001-2003 Explorer Sport 2001-2004 Explorer Sport Trac 2003-2004 Ranger ISSUE Some 2001-2003 Explorer Sport, 2001-2004 Explorer Sport Trac, and 2003-2004 Ranger vehicles may exhibit peeling, cracking and/or bubbling paint on the center finish panel of the instrument panel. ACTION Replace the center finish panel. Record the radio stations before removing the panel. Reprogram the radio before returning the vehicle to the customer. NOTE PRIOR TO INSTALLING THE NEW CENTER FINISH PANEL, LIGHTLY GREASE THE BACK SIDE OF THE NEW PANEL WITH ANTI-SQUEAK LUBRICANT, PART NUMBER D2AZ-19590-A (XG-8), TO PREVENT INSTRUMENT PANEL NOISE. AVOID GETTING GREASE ON THE FACE OF THE PANEL. Parts Block WARRANTY STATUS: Eligible Under Provisions Of New Vehicle Limited Warranty Coverage OPERATION DESCRIPTION TIME 051008A 2001-2003 Explorer Sport 0.3 Hr. (2Dr), 2001-2004 Explorer Sport Trac, 2003-2004 Ranger, Replace The Center Finish Panel (Do Not Use With 18805B, 18805C) DEALER CODING CONDITION BASIC PART NO. CODE 7004302 42 Disclaimer scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
