6261.html,Cruise Control Servo: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Suspension;Wiring;Interior,6,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;NOTE;REMOVAL 1;SPEED CONTROL SERVO,"Cruise Control Servo: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Cruise Control >> Cruise Control Servo >> Service and Repair Cruise Control Servo: Service and Repair SPEED CONTROL SERVO REMOVAL 1. Disconnect the electrical connector. 2. Depress the locking tab and rotate the speed control cable cap to remove. 3. Disconnect the speed control cable from the speed control servo pulley. 1 Gently push the retaining spring. 2 Disconnect the speed control cable slug. 4. Remove the bolt and the speed control servo and bracket. 5. Remove the bolts and separate the bracket from the speed control servo. INSTALLATION 1. NOTE: Make sure the rubber seal is fully seated onto the speed control cable cap. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
