ehicle Limited Warranty Coverage OPERATION DESCRIPTION TIME 051008A 2001-2003 Explorer Sport 0.3 Hr. (2Dr), 2001-2004 Explorer Sport Trac, 2003-2004 Ranger, Replace The Center Finish Panel (Do Not Use With 18805B, 18805C) DEALER CODING CONDITION BASIC PART NO. CODE 7004302 42 Disclaimer scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
6276.html,Interior - Accelerator Pedal Vibration at 1500-1800 RPM — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Suspension;Body;Interior,3,,,05 ACCELERATOR;0L VIN K;1500-1800 RPM;1800 RPM FORD;1960-2025;2001-2005;2004;2WD V6-4;ACTION;BUZZ AT 1500;CODE 9A758 43;CODING;CONDITION BASIC;DEALER;ISSUE;LEMON;PART NO;PEDAL VIBRATION;STATUS;TSB 05-10;WARRANTY,"Interior - Accelerator Pedal Vibration at 1500-1800 RPM — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Technical Service Bulletins >> By Symptom >> Customer Interest >> Interior - Accelerator Pedal Vibration at 1500-1800 RPM Interior - Accelerator Pedal Vibration at 1500-1800 RPM TSB 05-10-3 05/30/05 ACCELERATOR PEDAL VIBRATION/BUZZ AT 1500-1800 RPM FORD: 2001-2005 Explorer Sport Trac ISSUE Some 2001-2005 Explorer Sport Trac vehicles may exhibit the accelerator pedal vibrating or buzzing at 1500-1800 RPM. ACTION Ensure the accelerator cable and the hood release cables are not contacting the # 6 spark plug wire. Reposition cables as needed. Also, ensure that the accelerator cable is secure in the retention clip, and that the clip's spring tensioner is on top. Refer to Figure 1 (incorrect position) and Figure 2 (correct position). WARRANTY STATUS: Eligible Under Provisions Of New Vehicle Limited Warranty Coverage DEALER CODING CONDITION BASIC PART NO. CODE 9A758 43 Disclaimer scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
