6388.html,Seat Temperature Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring;Interior,7,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;HEATED SEAT;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL NOTE;SWITCH,"Seat Temperature Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Seats >> Seat Temperature Switch >> Service and Repair Seat Temperature Switch: Service and Repair HEATED SEAT SWITCH REMOVAL NOTE: Driver side shown, passenger side similar. 1. Remove the front seat. 2. Disconnect the power seat switch electrical connector (if equipped). 3. Remove the front seat cushion side shield rear screw. 4. Remove the front seat cushion side shield screws. 5. CAUTION: Use care when disconnecting the seat cushion side shield from the seat cushion frame so the tabs on the seat cushion side shield are not damaged. Disconnect the front seat cushion side shield. 6. Disconnect the power lumbar switch electrical connector and the power lumbar hose from the power lumbar switch. 7. Disconnect the heated seat switch electrical connector. 8. Pinch the retainer tabs and push the heated seat switch up and out of the seat side shield. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
