6405.html,Seat Cushion: Service Precautions — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Interior,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;LEMON,Seat Cushion: Service Precautions — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Seats >> Seat Cushion >> Service Precautions Seat Cushion: Service Precautions CAUTION: - Use care when separating the seat cushion trim cover from the hook and loop strip or the hook and loop strip may be torn from the seat cushion foam. - The flex mat J-clips must be installed with the openings facing down or the seat cushion may be damaged. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals
6406.html,Front Seat Cushion — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Interior,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CUSHION;FRONT SEAT;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL 1,"Front Seat Cushion — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Seats >> Seat Cushion >> Service and Repair >> Removal And Installation >> Front Seat Cushion Front Seat Cushion FRONT SEAT CUSHION REMOVAL 1. Remove the seat track . 2. Remove the seat backrest. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
