6419.html,Power Seat Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring;Interior,8,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL NOTE;SEAT CONTROL;SWITCH,"Power Seat Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Seats >> Power Seat Switch >> Service and Repair Power Seat Switch: Service and Repair SEAT CONTROL SWITCH REMOVAL NOTE: Driver side shown, passenger side similar. 1. Remove the front seat. 2. Disconnect the power seat switch electrical connector. 3. Remove the front seat cushion side shield rear screw. 4. Remove the front seat cushion side shield screws. 5. CAUTION: Use care when disconnecting the seat cushion side shield from the seat cushion frame so the tabs on the seat cushion side shield are not damaged. Disconnect the front seat cushion side shield. 6. Disconnect the power lumbar switch electrical connector and the power lumbar hose from the power lumbar switch (if equipped). 7. Disconnect the heated seat switch electrical connector (if equipped). 8. Remove the front seat cushion side shield. 9. Remove the 6-way power seat switch . - Remove the screws, then remove the 6-way power seat switch . INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
