6457.html,Paint Codes — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body,1,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;LEMON,"Paint Codes — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Paint, Striping and Decals >> Paint >> Application and ID >> Paint Codes Paint Codes The Vehicle Certification Label (VC) is located on the left-hand front door jamb. The first set of numbers/letters indicate the vehicle primary body color code. The second set of numbers/letters (if applicable), indicate a lower body, two-tone paint code. Primary body color codes - CY Competition Orange - DX Dark Blue Pearl - FX Merlot - G2 Redfire - JP Silver Birch Metallic - G3 Pueblo Gold - P5 Aspen Green Metallic - UA Ebony - YZ Oxford White scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
