6511.html,Power Door Lock Actuator: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring,5,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;ACTUATOR;FRONT DOOR LOCK;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL 1;SPECIAL TOOL,"Power Door Lock Actuator: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Locks >> Power Locks >> Power Door Lock Actuator >> Service and Repair Power Door Lock Actuator: Service and Repair FRONT DOOR LOCK ACTUATOR Heavy Duty Riveter: SPECIAL TOOL(S) REMOVAL 1. Remove the front door trim panel . 2. Position the watershield aside. 3. Remove the door glass run channel. 1 Remove the bolt. 2 Remove the door glass run channel. - Release the wiring harness locator. 4. Disconnect the door lock actuator electrical connector. 5. Remove the front door lock actuator rivet. 6. Release the wiring harness locator. 7. Remove the front door lock actuator. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. - Using the special tool, install the rivet. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
