6558.html,Rear Cross-Member: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Transmission;Body,4,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;262 E2FZ-19554;2WD V6-4;CROSSMEMBER;LEMON;NOTE;SUPPORT;TRANSMISSION;WSK-M2G351-A6,"Rear Cross-Member: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Frame >> Cross-Member >> Rear Cross-Member >> Service and Repair Rear Cross-Member: Service and Repair CROSSMEMBER - TRANSMISSION SUPPORT Material: Material Removal and Installation 1. Raise and support the vehicle. 2. Loosen, but do not remove, the nuts retaining the transmission insulator to the crossmember. 3. Support the transmission. 4. Remove the six bolts retaining the crossmember to the frame. 5. Remove the nuts and the crossmember. 6. NOTE: Apply Threadlock 262 E2FZ-19554-B meeting Ford specification WSK-M2G351-A6 or equivalent to the transmission crossmember mounting bolts. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
6559.html,Body / Frame Mount Bushing: Description and Operation — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body,3,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;5005;5D058;5D059;FRAME AND BODY;LEMON;MOUNTING,"Body / Frame Mount Bushing: Description and Operation — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Frame >> Body / Frame Mount Bushing >> Description and Operation Body / Frame Mount Bushing: Description and Operation FRAME AND BODY MOUNTING Body Support - Radiator Support: Body Support - Number 1: Body Support - Number 3: The frame consists of two steel channel rails, a rear crossmember, additional support crossmembers and a front crossmember. The rails and crossmembers are not to be removed from the frame (5005) for repair except for the spare tire carrier plate. A front frame rail repair kit (5D058 and 5D059) is available if the front rail is to be repaired scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
6560.html,Body Support - Number 1 — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Interior,6,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;262 E2FZ-19554;2WD V6-4;BODY SUPPORT;LEMON;NOTE;NUMBER 1;WSK-M2G351-A6,"Body Support - Number 1 — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Frame >> Body / Frame Mount Bushing >> Service and Repair >> Body Support - Number 1 Body Support - Number 1 BODY SUPPORT - NUMBER 1 Material: Material Removal and Installation Upper and Lower Insulator NOTE: Left side shown, right side similar. 1. Remove the door scuff plate. 2. Remove the A-pillar lower trim panel . 1. Remove the pin-type retainer. 2. Remove the A-pillar lower trim panel . 3. Position back the carpeting and remove the body insulator plug. 4. NOTE: This step may require holding the lower retainer with an appropriate tool. Remove the body mount insulator bolt. 5. NOTE: If the lower body mount will not remove, loosely install the body mount bolt and tap on the body mount bolt head with a hammer. Remove the lower body mount insulator. Upper Insulator 6. Loosen, but do not remove, all the remaining body mount insulator bolts. 7. Carefully raise the vehicle body enough to remove the upper body mount insulator. Upper and Lower Insulator 8. NOTE: - Apply Threadlock 262 E2FZ-19554-B meeting Ford specification WSK-M2G351-A6 or equivalent to the mounting bolt. - No lubricants of any kind are to be used during body insulator installation. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
