6598.html,Rear Door Window Glass: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Interior,8,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;NOTE;REAR DOOR;REMOVAL 1;SPECIAL TOOL;WINDOW GLASS,"Rear Door Window Glass: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Doors, Hood and Trunk >> Doors >> Rear Door >> Rear Door Window Glass >> Service and Repair Rear Door Window Glass: Service and Repair REAR DOOR WINDOW GLASS Heavy Duty Riveter: SPECIAL TOOL(S) REMOVAL 1. Remove the rear door trim panel . 2. Remove the interior glass weatherstrip . 3. Remove the rear door belt line moulding nut. 4. CAUTION: Do not strike or force the rear door belt line moulding during the installation. The rear door belt line moulding is made of aluminum and will be damaged. NOTE: During installation, make sure that the rear door belt line moulding fits flush with the edge of the sheet metal and the door panel shelf. Remove the rear door belt line moulding. 5. Position aside the water shield. 6. Connect the power window switch. 7. Remove the rear door window glass rivets. - Lower the glass approximately two-inches to access the rivets through the holes. 8. Carefully lower the window regulator while holding the glass. - Lower the glass. 9. Separate the front of the window run/ weatherstrip from the door. 10. Remove the rear door window glass through the outboard side of the rear door. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. - Use the special tool to install the rivets. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
6599.html,Rear Door Panel: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring,3,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;PANEL REMOVAL NOTE;REAR DOOR TRIM,"Rear Door Panel: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Doors, Hood and Trunk >> Doors >> Rear Door >> Rear Door Panel >> Service and Repair Rear Door Panel: Service and Repair REAR DOOR TRIM PANEL REMOVAL NOTE: RH door is shown, LH door is similar. 1. Remove the rear door window control switch panel and trim covers. 1 If equipped with power windows, remove the rear door window control switch and disconnect the electrical connector. 2 Remove the door screw cover. 3 Remove the door handle bezel. 2. Remove the door handle screws. 3. If not equipped with power windows, remove the screw and the window regulator handle. 4. Remove the screw and the rear door trim panel . INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
