6628.html,Front Bumper Cover / Fascia: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring,7,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;FRONT BUMPER COVER;LEMON,"Front Bumper Cover / Fascia: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Body and Frame >> Bumper >> Front Bumper >> Front Bumper Cover / Fascia >> Service and Repair Front Bumper Cover / Fascia: Service and Repair FRONT BUMPER COVER Removal and Installation 1. Remove the radiator grille sight shield. 1. Remove the bolts. 2. Release the retaining clips. 3. Remove the radiator grille sight shield. 2. Remove the two parking lamp assemblies. 1. Remove the two bolts (one each side). 2. Remove the two parking lamp assemblies. - Disconnect the electrical connectors. 3. Remove the two headlamp assemblies. 1. Pull upward to release the four tabs (two each side). 2. Remove the two headlamp assemblies. - Disconnect the electrical connectors. 4. Remove the three lower radiator air deflector bolts. 5. Remove the six fender splash shield screws (three each side). 6. Remove the two front bumper cover bolts from inside the fender opening (one each side). 7. Remove the front bumper cover. - Unclip the six locking tabs. 8. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
