6667.html,Initial Inspection and Diagnostic Overview — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Wiring,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;INSPECTION AND;INSPECTION CHART;LEMON;VERIFICATION 1;VISUAL,"Initial Inspection and Diagnostic Overview — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Accessories and Optional Equipment >> Towing / Trailer System >> Trailer Lamps >> Testing and Inspection >> Initial Inspection and Diagnostic Overview Initial Inspection and Diagnostic Overview INSPECTION AND VERIFICATION 1. Verify the customer concern. 2. Verify the exterior lighting system of the vehicle is operating correctly. If not, refer to the appropriate pinpoint test. 3. Visually inspect for obvious signs of mechanical or electrical damage. VISUAL INSPECTION CHART Electrical - Central junction box (CJB) fuse(s): - 3 (7.5A) - 7 (7.5A) - Battery junction box (BJB) fuse(s): - 23 (15A) - Circuitry - Trailer tow relay - Bulb(s) 4. If the fault is not visually evident, determine the symptom and go to the Symptom Chart. Symptom Related Diagnostic Procedures scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
