7218.html,Rear Cross-Member: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Transmission;Suspension,4,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;262 E2FZ-19554;2WD V6-4;CROSSMEMBER;LEMON;NOTE;SUPPORT;TRANSMISSION;WSK-M2G351-A6,"Rear Cross-Member: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Steering and Suspension >> Suspension >> Cross-Member >> Rear Cross-Member >> Service and Repair Rear Cross-Member: Service and Repair CROSSMEMBER - TRANSMISSION SUPPORT Material: Material Removal and Installation 1. Raise and support the vehicle. 2. Loosen, but do not remove, the nuts retaining the transmission insulator to the crossmember. 3. Support the transmission. 4. Remove the six bolts retaining the crossmember to the frame. 5. Remove the nuts and the crossmember. 6. NOTE: Apply Threadlock 262 E2FZ-19554-B meeting Ford specification WSK-M2G351-A6 or equivalent to the transmission crossmember mounting bolts. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
