7688.html,Attachment I - Administrative Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Transmission,0,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2005;2WD V6-4;ACESII;ACTIVATED;ADDITIONAL LABOR;CLAIMS;DAMAGE;FSA VIN;FSA VIN LIST;LEMON;NOTE;OASIS;OASIS ACTIVATED;PREPARATION AND;RELATED;RENTAL;SALVAGED;SOLD VEHICLES;STOCK VEHICLES;SUBMISSION;TIME;TITLE BRANDED;VEHICLES,"Attachment I - Administrative Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Transmission and Drivetrain >> Technical Service Bulletins >> By Symptom >> Recalls >> Campaign - Additive For A/T Fluid >> Attachment I - Administrative Information Attachment I - Administrative Information OASIS ACTIVATED? Yes, OASIS was activated on 01/04/2005. FSA VIN LIST ACTIVATED? Yes Available on the website on 01/06/2005. Owner names and addresses were made available on 01/12/2005. NOTE : Your FSA VIN list may contain owner names and addresses obtained from motor vehicle registration records. The use of such motor vehicle registration data for any purpose other than in connection with this program is a violation of law in several states, provinces, and countries. Accordingly, you must limit the use of this listing to the follow-up necessary to complete this field service action. STOCK VEHICLES Repair all in-stock vehicles prior to delivery. SOLD VEHICLES ^ Owners of affected vehicles have been directed to dealers for repairs. ^ Immediately contact any of your affected owners whose vehicles are not on your VIN lists but are identified in OASIS. Give the owner a copy of the Customer Notification Letter and schedule a service date. ^ Correct other affected vehicles identified in OASIS which are brought to your dealership. TITLE BRANDED / SALVAGED VEHICLES Affected title branded and salvaged vehicles are eligible for this Field Service Action. RELATED DAMAGE Related damage claims are not approved for this program. ADDITIONAL LABOR TIME This repair will require no additional labor time to complete. Claims submitted with ""MT"" labor will not be accepted for reimbursement. RENTAL VEHICLES The use of rental vehicles is not authorized for this program. CLAIMS PREPARATION AND SUBMISSION ^ Enter claims using Direct Warranty Entry (DWE). ^ Refer to ACESII manual for claims preparation and submission information. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
7689.html,Attachment II - Labor and Parts Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Transmission,2,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;4000;DEALER PRICE;DOES II;EXCESS STOCK;INFORMATION;LABOR ALLOWANCES;LEMON;ORDERING;PARTS REQUIREMENTS;RETURN,"Attachment II - Labor and Parts Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Transmission and Drivetrain >> Technical Service Bulletins >> By Symptom >> Recalls >> Campaign - Additive For A/T Fluid >> Attachment II - Labor and Parts Information Attachment II - Labor and Parts Information LABOR ALLOWANCES PARTS REQUIREMENTS / ORDERING INFORMATION DEALER PRICE For latest prices, refer to DOES II. EXCESS STOCK RETURN Excess stock returned for credit must have been purchased from Ford Customer Service Division in accordance with Policy Procedure Bulletin 4000. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
7690.html,Attachment III - Technical Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Transmission,8,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2004 LS;2005;2005 LS;2WD V6-4;LEMON;OVERVIEW,"Attachment III - Technical Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Transmission and Drivetrain >> Technical Service Bulletins >> By Symptom >> Recalls >> Campaign - Additive For A/T Fluid >> Attachment III - Technical Information Attachment III - Technical Information OVERVIEW This program involves adding a fluid additive to the automatic transmission. ^ For Ranger and Explorer Sport Trac models, the additive will be added to the transmission through the fluid level indicator (dipstick) tube. ^ For 2004 LS and Thunderbird models, the additive will be added through the extension housing fill port. ^ For2005 LE and Thunderbird, and 2004 and 2005 Explorer, Mountaineer and Aviator models, the additive will be added to the transmission through the transmission pan fluid level tube while the engine is running. This procedure requires the transmission fluid temperature (TFT) to be below 38° C (100°F) to ensure fluid level is below the top of the fluid level tube. See Figure 1. Use WDS or NGS to determine transmission fluid temperature. Warning Label 2004 and 2005 Ranger and Explorer Sport Trac 2004 LS and Thunderbird 2005 LS and Thunderbird, and 2004 and 2005 Explorer/Mountaineer and Aviator scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
