8001.html,Attachment III - Technical Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Body,1,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CONTROL;EMISSION;INFORMATION;LABEL REPLACEMENT;LEMON;PROCEDURE VECI;SERVICE;VECI;VEHICLE,"Attachment III - Technical Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Technical Service Bulletins >> By Symptom >> Recalls >> Recall - Incorrect VECI Label Installed at Production >> Attachment III - Technical Information Attachment III - Technical Information VEHICLE EMISSION CONTROL INFORMATION (VECI) LABEL REPLACEMENT SERVICE PROCEDURE VECI LABEL REPLACEMENT 1. Open the hood and locate the Vehicle Emission Control Information (VECI) label located on the passenger side of the radiator upper support. 2. Remove and discard the original label. Using the supplied alcohol cleaning pad, clean the area of all label adhesive residue. 3. Affix the new label (with part number suffix LAX) onto the radiator support in the same location as the original. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
