8016.html,Attachment I - Administrative Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,,0,,,04L18;0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;800-325-5621;ACESII;ACTIVATED;CLAIMS;DAMAGE;DELIVERY HOLD;DEMONSTRATION;FSA VIN LIST;IN-STOCK;LEMON;OASIS;OASIS ACTIVATED;PREPARATION AND;RELATED;SALVAGED;SOLD VEHICLES VECI;SUBMISSION;TITLE BRANDED;VECI;VEHICLES,"Attachment I - Administrative Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Technical Service Bulletins >> All Technical Service Bulletins >> Recall - Incorrect VECI Label Installed at Production >> Attachment I - Administrative Information Attachment I - Administrative Information DEMONSTRATION/DELIVERY HOLD Special Field Action 04L18 Certain 2004 Model Year Explorer Sport Trac Vehicles VECI Label Replacement OASIS ACTIVATED? Yes. OASIS will be activated by 4/30/2004. FSA VIN LIST ACTIVATED? Yes (In-Stock Units only) IN-STOCK VEHICLES Correct all affected in-stock vehicles before delivery. To order additional VECI labels, call the Special Service Support Center at 1-800-325-5621. SOLD VEHICLES VECI labels are being mailed to owners; however, owners may choose to have the dealer install the label. TITLE BRANDED/SALVAGED VEHICLES Affected title branded and salvaged vehicles are eligible for this Field Service Action. RELATED DAMAGE Claims with related damage will not be accepted for reimbursement. CLAIMS PREPARATION AND SUBMISSION ^ Enter claims using Direct Warranty Entry (DWE). ^ Refer to ACESII manual for claims preparation and submission information. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
8017.html,Attachment II - Labor Allowances and Parts Ordering Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,,1,,,04L18;0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;800-325-5621;DEALER PRICE;LABOR ALLOWANCES;LEMON;PARTS REQUIREMENTS;VECI,"Attachment II - Labor Allowances and Parts Ordering Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Technical Service Bulletins >> All Technical Service Bulletins >> Recall - Incorrect VECI Label Installed at Production >> Attachment II - Labor Allowances and Parts Ordering Information Attachment II - Labor Allowances and Parts Ordering Information LABOR ALLOWANCES PARTS REQUIREMENTS Ordering Instructions for Additional VECI Labels VECI labels for this program are being sent directly to dealers and customers. Additional labels may be ordered as follows (for customers who prefer to have this label installed at the dealership and arrive without the label). To order additional labels, call 1-800-325-5621: ^ Ask for additional VECI labels for program 04L18. ^ Provide your name, dealership P/A code, and mailing address. Provide VIN, model year and make of vehicle(s). DEALER PRICE Dealers will not be charged for labels ordered for this program. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
8018.html,Attachment III - Technical Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Body,1,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CONTROL;EMISSION;INFORMATION;LABEL REPLACEMENT;LEMON;PROCEDURE VECI;SERVICE;VECI;VEHICLE,"Attachment III - Technical Information — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Technical Service Bulletins >> All Technical Service Bulletins >> Recall - Incorrect VECI Label Installed at Production >> Attachment III - Technical Information Attachment III - Technical Information VEHICLE EMISSION CONTROL INFORMATION (VECI) LABEL REPLACEMENT SERVICE PROCEDURE VECI LABEL REPLACEMENT 1. Open the hood and locate the Vehicle Emission Control Information (VECI) label located on the passenger side of the radiator upper support. 2. Remove and discard the original label. Using the supplied alcohol cleaning pad, clean the area of all label adhesive residue. 3. Affix the new label (with part number suffix LAX) onto the radiator support in the same location as the original. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
