8312.html,Evaporative System Service Port: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Wiring,6,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;EMISSION TEST;EVAP;EVAPORATIVE;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;PORT REMOVAL 1,"Evaporative System Service Port: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Emission Control Systems >> Evaporative Emissions System >> Evaporative System Service Port >> Service and Repair Evaporative System Service Port: Service and Repair EVAPORATIVE EMISSION TEST PORT REMOVAL 1. Release the evaporative emission (EVAP) test port pin-type retainer. 2. Disconnect the vapor tube. 3. Remove the battery junction box bracket bolts. Position the junction box aside. 4. Disconnect the EVAP canister purge valve electrical connector. 5. Slide the EVAP canister purge valve off the mounting bracket. Position the valve to allow access to the vapor tubes. 6. Disconnect the vapor tube and remove the EVAP test port assembly. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. - Leak test the evaporative emissions system . Evaporative Emission System Leak Test - Carry out the evaporative emission repair verification drive cycle. Evaporative Emission Repair Verification Drive Cycle scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
