8614.html,Gasoline Fuel System — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine,0,,,0L VIN K;134-R0087 OR;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;EQUIPPED WITH;EQUIVALENT;HANDLING;LEMON;ON VEHICLES NOT;POINT;PRESSURE TEST;SCHRADER VALVE;USE ROTUNDA FUEL;WARNING,"Gasoline Fuel System — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Powertrain Management >> Tune-up and Engine Performance Checks >> Fuel Pressure >> Fuel Pressure Test Port >> Description and Operation >> Gasoline Fuel System Gasoline Fuel System PRESSURE TEST POINT There is a pressure test point with a schrader fitting in the fuel rail that relieves fuel pressure and measures the fuel injector supply pressure for service and diagnostic procedures. Before servicing or testing the fuel system, read any CAUTION, WARNING, and HANDLING information. ON VEHICLES NOT EQUIPPED WITH A SCHRADER VALVE, USE ROTUNDA FUEL PRESSURE TEST KIT #134-R0087 OR EQUIVALENT. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
