8753.html,Exhaust Manifold LH — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine,3,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;LEMON;NOTE,"Exhaust Manifold LH — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Engine, Cooling and Exhaust >> Exhaust System >> Exhaust Manifold >> Service and Repair >> Exhaust Manifold LH Exhaust Manifold LH Exhaust Manifold LH Removal and Installation 1. Raise and support the vehicle. 2. Remove the exhaust pipe -to- exhaust manifold bolts. 3. Lower the vehicle. 4. Remove the exhaust gas recirculation (EGR) tube. ^ Disconnect the differential pressure feedback EGR system from the EGR tube. ^ Disconnect the EGR tube from the EGR valve and the exhaust manifold . 5. Remove the LH exhaust manifold. 6. NOTE: Use new exhaust manifold gaskets and retaining nuts. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
