8773.html,Thermostat: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Wiring,3,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;LEMON,"Thermostat: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Engine, Cooling and Exhaust >> Cooling System >> Thermostat >> Service and Repair Thermostat: Service and Repair Thermostat Removal and Installation 1. Drain the engine cooling system . 2. Remove the air cleaner outlet tube. 3. Remove the generator wiring harness pin-type retainer and position the wiring harness aside. 4. Disconnect the upper radiator hose. 5. Remove the bolts, water outlet adapter, and thermostat. - Inspect the O-ring seal, install a new O-ring seal if necessary. 6. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
