8778.html,Coolant Temperature Sensor/Switch (For Computer): Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Wiring,2,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;COOLANT;ENGINE;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;REMOVAL 1;SENSOR;TEMPERATURE,"Coolant Temperature Sensor/Switch (For Computer): Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Engine, Cooling and Exhaust >> Cooling System >> Sensors and Switches - Cooling System >> Engine - Coolant Temperature Sensor/Switch >> Coolant Temperature Sensor/Switch (For Computer) >> Service and Repair Coolant Temperature Sensor/Switch (For Computer): Service and Repair ENGINE COOLANT TEMPERATURE (ECT) SENSOR REMOVAL 1. Partially drain the cooling system. 2. Disconnect the engine coolant temperature (ECT) sensor electrical connector. 3. Remove the retaining clip and the ECT sensor. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
