ol, install the crankshaft pulley. 3. Using the special tool, install a new crankshaft pulley bolt. Tighten the bolt in two stages. ^ Stage 1: Tighten the bolt to 50 Nm (37 ft. lbs.). ^ Stage 2: Tighten the bolt an additional 90 degrees. 4. Install the accessory drive belt. 5. Install the fan shroud. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
