9105.html,A/C - Moaning From Engine Compartment — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Engine;Interior,2,,,04 MOAN;042511A;0L VIN K;11 12;1960-2025;2001-2005;2004;2WD V6-4;412-03;ACTION;CODE 19D734 42;CODING;CONDITION BASIC;DEALER;DESCRIPTION TIME;DURING A;HVAC;ISSUE;LEMON;OPERATION;OPERATION FORD;PART NO;STATUS;TSB 04-25;VIBRATION;WARRANTY,"A/C - Moaning From Engine Compartment — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Maintenance >> Hoses >> Hose/Line HVAC >> Technical Service Bulletins >> Customer Interest >> A/C - Moaning From Engine Compartment A/C - Moaning From Engine Compartment TSB 04-25-11 12/27/04 MOAN/VIBRATION DURING A/C OPERATION FORD: 2001-2005 Explorer Sport Trac ISSUE Some 2001-2005 Explorer Sport Trac vehicles may exhibit a moan/vibration coming from the engine compartment while the A/C is on and the engine is at low RPM. The noise will only occur when the A/C compressor is running. ACTION Replace the manifold and tube assembly on the A/C compressor. Refer to Workshop Manual Section 412-03. Parts Block WARRANTY STATUS: Eligible Under Provisions Of New Vehicle Limited Warranty Coverage OPERATION DESCRIPTION TIME 042511A Replace The Manifold And 1.7 Hrs. Tube Assembly On The A/C Compressor (Includes Time To Recover, Evacuate And Charge The Air Conditioning System) DEALER CODING CONDITION BASIC PART NO. CODE 19D734 42 Disclaimer scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
