9422.html,Vacuum/Pressure Pump Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals,Body;Wiring;Interior,7,,,0L VIN K;1960-2025;2004;2WD V6-4;CAUTION;CONTROL;INSTALLATION 1;LEMON;LUMBAR;REMOVAL NOTE;SWITCH,"Vacuum/Pressure Pump Switch: Service and Repair — 2004 Ford Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel Service Manual ~ LEMON Manuals LEMON Manuals : Even more car manuals for everyone: 1960-2025 Home >> Ford >> 2004 >> Explorer Sport Trac 2WD V6-4.0L VIN K Flex Fuel >> Repair and Diagnosis >> Sensors and Switches >> Sensors and Switches - Body and Frame >> Vacuum/Pressure Pump Switch >> Service and Repair Vacuum/Pressure Pump Switch: Service and Repair LUMBAR CONTROL SWITCH REMOVAL NOTE: Driver side shown, passenger side similar. 1. Remove the front seat. 2. Disconnect the power seat switch electrical connector (if equipped). 3. Remove the front seat cushion side shield rear screw. 4. Remove the front seat cushion side shield screws. 5. CAUTION: Use care when disconnecting the seat cushion side shield from the seat cushion frame so the tabs on the seat cushion side shield are not damaged. Disconnect the front seat cushion side shield. 6. Disconnect the power lumbar switch electrical connector and the power lumbar hose from the power lumbar switch. 7. Disconnect the heated seat switch electrical connector (if equipped). 8. Remove the power lumbar switch. INSTALLATION 1. To install, reverse the removal procedure. scientia non olet · About LEMON Manuals"
